1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,108
You open protected export to create
offline copies of clinic records.

2
00:00:04,108 --> 00:00:08,514
Entering the facility export password
unlocks an encrypted audit workbook.

3
00:00:08,514 --> 00:00:12,861
You can also download a full encrypted
database archive for safe storage.

4
00:00:12,861 --> 00:00:17,564
In Google Sheets backup, automated
replication settings keep an offsite
record.

5
00:00:17,564 --> 00:00:22,864
Scheduled synchronization runs quietly in
the background whenever a network is
connected.
